{"id":"71456060817","kind":"answer","title":"怎么看待期末考试前最后一周才开始学习的大学生？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"学校教育问题","date":"2025-01-04","updated":"2025-01-04","votes":277,"comment_count":25,"minutes":2,"chars":844,"keywords":["应试教育","考试评价","学习动机","高校招生","创业公司"],"summary":"让我回想起四年前上网课的自己，睡了大半年后，回学校 13 天连考 7 门课的事。 这让我每门课只有一天半的时间学，比什么最后一周紧张刺激多了。 这七门课分别为《算法设计与分析》、《计算方法》、《计算机组成原理》、《近世代数》、《数理逻辑》、《毛概》、《马原》。 说实话，现在已经全部忘光光了。 但是备考的方法我还是记得的。首先准…","question_detail_html":"","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/8342765707/answer/71456060817","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"oBm_KDy8\">让我回想起四年前上网课的自己，睡了大半年后，回学校 13 天连考 7 门课的事。</p><p data-pid=\"B0aZmbrQ\">这让我每门课只有一天半的时间学，比什么最后一周紧张刺激多了。</p><p data-pid=\"Aplq0K7I\">这七门课分别为《算法设计与分析》、《计算方法》、《计算机组成原理》、《近世代数》、《数理逻辑》、《毛概》、《马原》。</p><p data-pid=\"LtZq9GRT\">说实话，现在已经全部忘光光了。</p><p data-pid=\"Mls9bNeV\">但是备考的方法我还是记得的。首先准备好教材，然后对着 PPT 把重点划来下背一下。再把每门课的作业全部背下来。然后参考一下考研的题库，把常见题研究一下。最后再找一下往年试题刷一刷。</p><p data-pid=\"Jxo9GD2_\">当然这样做的结果也是惨不忍睹，没有一门专业课 90 分以上，甚至还收获了一门 80 分以下：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-9ca0191b1d7c63922fad71622690a8e1_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-0939336e4617a0d3bbfb39f47bc3c85d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-0939336e4617a0d3bbfb39f47bc3c85d_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2230\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-9ca0191b1d7c63922fad71622690a8e1_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-0939336e4617a0d3bbfb39f47bc3c85d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-0939336e4617a0d3bbfb39f47bc3c85d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2230\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-8c2c60ccb621cfe4b28e674a9f5f5a83_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-8c2c60ccb621cfe4b28e674a9f5f5a83\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-8c2c60ccb621cfe4b28e674a9f5f5a83_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2230\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-8c2c60ccb621cfe4b28e674a9f5f5a83_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-8c2c60ccb621cfe4b28e674a9f5f5a83\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-8c2c60ccb621cfe4b28e674a9f5f5a83_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2230\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"49l4oBAV\">然后我的学分绩就掉到了 90 分以下：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-45be964ffee065b1c8b3ef7182335176_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-5aabf7f44563bbca4a2ac3063a129f69\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-5aabf7f44563bbca4a2ac3063a129f69_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"952\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-45be964ffee065b1c8b3ef7182335176_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-5aabf7f44563bbca4a2ac3063a129f69\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-5aabf7f44563bbca4a2ac3063a129f69_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"952\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"DMVgVAse\">这对我的影响是极大的：我从拿到成绩的那一刻起，就打消了保研的念头，开始准备就业。那个时候我刚好从墨墨背单词实习回来，正在纠结之后的出路是读研还是就业。</p><p data-pid=\"RBZDtIit\">可以说，如果这波返校期末考我没考砸，那我可能现在还在边读研边找工作呢。</p><p data-pid=\"gNOiIExp\">你说怎么看待这个事呢。我只会说我绝对不会后悔。大三开始，我就几乎翘掉了所有可以翘掉的课，去企业实习<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>。然后所有考试都是只提前一周准备，完全不担心自己会挂科。</p><p data-pid=\"4nEjuUWJ\">到了大四，我直接玩失踪，除了毕业答辩和毕业典礼我在学校，其余时间全在墨墨完成我的科研项目<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>，发了三篇核心/顶会/顶刊论文。</p><p data-pid=\"2HQL3F1s\">正是有这些经历，我才敢说，在大学考得好没啥用，真要学知识，还得靠自学。</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-e8264842e9555bc25508c1460a9baba1_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"834\" data-image-width=\"1200\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/528574739\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo：【随笔】我，毕业了。</a><p data-pid=\"hkoBSdnb\">真要创造价值，还得先摒弃应试思维。</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-aa917a4502a2507e71d68f469a727912_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1080\" data-image-width=\"1920\" data-tm-id=\"704855447\" href=\"#/post/704855447\">Thoughts Memo：摒弃应试思维 - 保罗•格雷厄姆（硅谷创业教父）</a><p data-pid=\"keMNNuVs\">与各位学弟学妹们共勉。</p><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 如何看待哈工大深圳禁止请假实习？ <a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/455294201/answer/1841787052\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.zhihu.com/question/455294201/answer/1841787052</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 我是如何在本科期间发表顶会论文的？（内含开源代码和数据集） <a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/543325359\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/543325359</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"704855447","title":"摒弃应试思维 - 保罗•格雷厄姆（硅谷创业教父）","author":"Paul Graham","votes":328,"minutes":16,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"19966155821","title":"文凭的终结 - 保罗•格雷厄姆（硅谷创业教父）","author":"Paul Graham","votes":76,"minutes":10,"reason":"延伸深读 · Paul Graham"},{"id":"708077659","title":"车票理论：什么造就了天才？- 保罗•格雷厄姆（硅谷创业教父）","author":"Paul Graham","votes":146,"minutes":11,"reason":"延伸深读 · Paul Graham"},{"id":"712910928","title":"那些年我们对孩子撒过的谎（父母对我们撒过的谎） - 保罗•格雷厄姆（硅谷创业教父）","author":"Paul Graham","votes":102,"minutes":21,"reason":"延伸深读 · Paul Graham"},{"id":"705411294","title":"还有两条要摒弃的学校思维","author":"Eliezer Yudkowsky","votes":470,"minutes":3,"reason":"延伸深读 · Eliezer Yudkowsky"},{"id":"1947225551837304378","title":"边缘的力量","author":"Paul Graham","votes":60,"minutes":25,"reason":"延伸深读 · Paul Graham"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2061824722631915180","title":"为什么现在的部分孩子开始抱怨作文的规矩了并且在作文的评论区里开始了“维护利益”呢？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":2299,"minutes":4,"reason":"相似问答 · 2299 赞同"},{"id":"2050874126877864447","title":"如何看待饺子未入围第 38 届百花奖最佳导演提名？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":1843,"minutes":3,"reason":"相似问答 · 1843 赞同"},{"id":"2044551131339150511","title":"张雪给做题家们的震撼到底有多大？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":749,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 749 赞同"},{"id":"81464216833","title":"大家觉得学生时代的努力就是「卷」吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":175,"minutes":6,"reason":"相似问答 · 175 赞同"},{"id":"2066958473557021510","title":"既然中国人学的是假的应试英语，是哑巴英语，那么是否意味着这是浪费时间，毫无意义？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":476,"minutes":4,"reason":"相似问答 · 476 赞同"}]}